            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Inkdoodler"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Not bad. Grenadine has a higher specific gravity than any of the other ingredients though so I’m pretty sure that part is an error. Anyone having a hard time finding banana liqueur should find 99 bananas is pretty readily available in most stores.",
